---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
flowchart TD
    StateChange[State change transaction]
    Pending[Outbox pending]
    Dedupe{Dedupe key exists?}
    Ready{Pending and available now?}
    Claim[FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED over pending index]
    Leased[Pending with future available_at]
    Publish[Bounded concurrent publish to queue]
    Published[Outbox published]
    Retry[Pending with retry delay]
    Failed[Outbox failed]
    Noop[No transition]
    Queue[Message broker]

    StateChange --> Dedupe
    Dedupe -- No --> Pending
    Dedupe -- Yes --> Noop

    Pending --> Ready
    Retry --> Ready

    Ready -- Yes --> Claim --> Leased --> Publish --> Queue
    Ready -- No --> Noop

    Publish -- Success --> Published
    Publish -- Failure --> Retry
    Retry --> Pending

    Pending -. Direct administrative update .-> Failed

    class StateChange command
    class Pending,Dedupe,Ready,Claim,Leased,Publish,Retry system
    class Published success
    class Failed error
    class Noop component
    class Queue external
